-ae92-7ccb-85b6-009d419900ef","description":"MiG","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7ae9-8595-ff9af098c132","description":"Ilyushin Il-86","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-72f5-9c36-e3893fa3edef","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Who is the Greek equivalent of the Roman god Mars?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ares was associated with the violence and bloodshed of battle, while the Romans\u2019 Mars also became a major protector of the state and agriculture.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7798-9bde-a52ff2a16b57","description":"Ares","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7c37-bad3-029eb01ae6b3","description":"Athena","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7601-afd3-1ff685ebd92a","description":"Hephaestus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-73a5-8f90-cfa5238e9701","description":"Zeus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7027-b823-80a67a5fec83","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the store where customers can build and customize their own stuffed animals?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"At Build-A-Bear, customers can help stuff their plush toy and choose its clothes and accessories.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7e99-ab1f-1eeafed71a6b","description":"Build-A-Bear","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-775a-b140-25ba39584c32","description":"Teddy Bear Emporium","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-73d0-bf13-4d01c70c68b4","description":"Toy Workshop","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-7eeb-b4b8-6e6709d69a00","description":"Plush Pals","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae92-71d2-aed5-491c95938b20","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these Latin phrases means \'A beard doesn\'t make one a philosopher\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Barba non facit philosophum draws on the traditional image of ancient philosophers as bearded men, while warning that appearance alo